; THE WEIR - the other end of the marsh road, and the place the errand is actually about.
;
; This one IS pre-armed: two marsh-jacks standing on it when you walk in, exactly the way an
; ashfall room is. A place whose standings are all foes is the degenerate case of a place, and it
; has to stay this cheap to write or the whole reframe was wrong.
;
; Slot 3 is the sluice gate - a thing to open rather than somebody to fight - and slot 4 is the
; way back to the quay.
;
;   .  floor      ~  difficult ground   #  rock      @  the hero starts
;   1-9 a spawn   |  wall up a line     -  wall along a line   x  door, shut   +  a corner

